###
### SESSION REQUESTS ENDPOINTS
###

### Get All Session Requests
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/session-requests
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Pending Session Requests
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/session-requests/pending
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Session Request by ID
@sessionRequestId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/session-requests/{{sessionRequestId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Session Requests by Patient
@patientId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/session-requests/patient/{{patientId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Session Requests by Psychologist
@psychologistId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/session-requests/psychologist/{{psychologistId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create Session Request
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/session-requests
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "patientId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "initialMessage": "Necesito ayuda con ansiedad y estrés laboral"
}

### Assign Psychologist to Session Request
@assignSessionRequestId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/session-requests/{{assignSessionRequestId}}/assign-psychologist
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "psychologistId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000"
}

### Update Session Request Status (Accept)
@updateSessionRequestId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/session-requests/{{updateSessionRequestId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "status": "Accepted"
}

### Update Session Request Status (Reject)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/session-requests/{{updateSessionRequestId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "status": "Rejected"
}

### Delete Session Request
@deleteSessionRequestId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/session-requests/{{deleteSessionRequestId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
### CHATS ENDPOINTS
###

### Get Chat by ID
@chatId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/chats/{{chatId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Chat with Messages
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/chats/{{chatId}}/with-messages
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Chat by Session Request ID
@chatSessionRequestId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/chats/session-request/{{chatSessionRequestId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create Chat
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/chats
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "sessionRequestId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000"
}

### Close Chat
@closeChatId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/chats/{{closeChatId}}/close
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Delete Chat
@deleteChatId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/chats/{{deleteChatId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
### MESSAGES ENDPOINTS
###

### Get Chat Messages
@messageChatId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/messages/chat/{{messageChatId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Send Message
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/messages
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "chatId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "senderUserId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "message": "Hola, necesito ayuda con mi ansiedad"
}

### Send Another Message
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/messages
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "chatId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "senderUserId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "message": "¿Podrías darme algunos consejos?"
}

### Delete Message
@deleteMessageId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/messages/{{deleteMessageId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
### VIA API GATEWAY
###

### Get All Session Requests via Gateway
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/session-requests
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create Session Request via Gateway
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/session-requests
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "patientId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "initialMessage": "Solicitud vía API Gateway"
}

### Send Message via Gateway
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/messages
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "chatId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "senderUserId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "message": "Mensaje enviado vía API Gateway"
}

### Health Check via Gateway
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/chat/health

